        "Prompt wedge: one graph, one job per row.\n\nEach row of the PD Wedge pairs a prompt (String node) with a short name (value_n). The prompt goes to CLIP Text Encode; the name becomes {look} in PD Save.\n\nPress \"preview wedge\" on PD Save to see the file names, then Run: 3 jobs, same seed."
      ],
